UID:event-saudi-international-falcons-hunting-exhibition@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260709T132515Z
DTSTART:20261001T110000Z
DTEND:20261010T190000Z
SUMMARY:Saudi International Falcons & Hunting Exhibition
DESCRIPTION:The Saudi International Falcons and Hunting Exhibition is one of the largest events dedicated to falconry and hunting in Saudi and globally. It brings together everything related to falconry and outdoor excursions\, from falcons and hunting tools to equipment and gear associated with hunting trips\, all within a comprehensive space that allows visitors to explore this field in one place. The exhibition also features platforms showcasing a wide range of brands\, alongside accompanying activities and events suitable for families\, creating an experience that blends cultural and entertainment elements. The event plays an important role in preserving falconry heritage and raising awareness by offering content that introduces visitors to its history and significance within Saudi’s cultural identity.
LOCATION:Riyadh
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-saudi-international-falcons-hunting-exhibition.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-saudi-falcons-club-auction@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260709T132515Z
DTSTART:20261001T160000Z
DTEND:20261130T200000Z
SUMMARY:Saudi Falcons Club Auction
DESCRIPTION:The Saudi Falcons Club organizes an annual auction dedicated to locally caught falcons\, known as “Al Tarh falcons\,” which are captured during the hunting season. The auction is a structured platform that brings falconers together to showcase their falcons in a competitive live bidding environment\, enabling reliable buying and selling. The event is broadcast on television channels and digital platforms. The club also provides integrated services for falcon owners\, including transportation to the auction venue\, along with facilities that organize and enhance the participation experience\, all within a framework aimed at developing falcon auctions in Saudi. The auction also contributes to raising awareness about preserving falcon breeds by regulating sales and emphasizing the protection of endangered species.
LOCATION:Riyadh
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-saudi-falcons-club-auction.html
END:VEVENT
